  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/937bab0a-fb7b-4695-9438-8e55e1163bfc-image.png\" style=\"width: 248px; height: 156px;\" /><br /><br />Let length of tower be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mi>&#8242;</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi></math></p><p>And <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>cot</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>h</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mi>&#8242;</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>h</mi></math></p><p>Time taken by car form <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>C</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>Time take by car to reach the foot of the tower</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>18</mn><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi></math></p>",
